  "slug": "line-startup-quality-report-form",
  "title": "Line Startup Quality Report Form",
  "subtitle": "Reconcile the production line clearance, setup, and controlled release population, summarize evidence and trends, separate limitations from conclusions, assign decisions, and track follow-up.",
  "description": "A decision-ready line startup quality report form that turns source records for a line, product, work order, and startup configuration into reconciled measures, exception patterns, qualified conclusions, owned actions, and a retrievable reporting package.",
  "use_case": "Use when the production, maintenance, safety, or quality release owner needs a bounded quality report for the production line clearance, setup, and controlled release rather than a raw inspection checklist or chronological log.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
